  "definition": "Procedures for License Suspension or Revocation",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-05-22",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 1500) #13496, INTERIM, eff 11-27-22; ss by #13621, eff 5-22-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 1500)",
